third_party/*
!third_party/README.md

# ironkernel/ is a separate PRIVATE repository nested here (never pushed from this repository): the network
# core wrapper, the netlist and library build scripts and the network firmware glue. tools/setup_ironkernel.py
# clones it when missing and pulls the RTLNet trees into ironkernel/src (tools/ironkernel.json).
/ironkernel/
